  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As an alternative to specifying a direction and a length, allow authors to specify an endpoint transform that would be used to calculate the former. This would enable support for cases where you would want to check a raycast between two dynamic points (e.g. left hand and right hand, or between two physbones)\n\nIn the absence of this feature, you can sort of achieve something similar by using a raycast combined with a VRCLookAtConstraint, but deriving and applying the correct length to apply to the raycast is impractical given the tools currently available to avatar creators.",
